{"about_the_game":"Get ready to put your tiny paws to the test in Hamster Blitz, a third-person wave defense game where you and up to 3 other friends work together to defend your household from waves of devious rats. Maneuver around using your hamster ball and multitask your defensive efforts to survive as many rounds as possible. Experiment with all sorts of crazy strategies and fast-paced movement mechanics to suit your unique play style as you unlock unique upgrades between rounds. This is a cute and charming, yet action-packed and intense romp of an experience that will deliver a satisfying and worthy challenge to both casual and experienced players alike.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1787190?t=1696660309","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787190/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1696660309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787190/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1696660309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787190/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1696660309","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>As of 2023, Further development of Hamster Blitz! has come to an end.</strong><br>Thank you to everyone who showed support and enthusiasm to our game!<br>- Mellow Armadillo</h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Get ready to put your tiny paws to the test in Hamster Blitz, a third-person wave defense game